OL,4,BHappy Potters and the deathly Hammers  
OL,5,GYou've dug the de-icer and novelty     
OL,6,Gjumpers out the back of the cupboard   
OL,7,Gand within days a square of chocolate  
OL,8,Gbefore breakfast will be socially      
OL,9,Gacceptable again.                      
OL,11,FDecember is looming large, but you can 
OL,12,Fbe sure the season of goodwill does    
OL,13,Fnot extend to the English Football     
OL,14,FLeague.                                
